# Generated build outputs. Neither can be reproduced faithfully across
# environments, so committing them guaranteed a dirty tree after every build:
#   public/sitemap.xml   - derived from live Sanity content and updated_at values
#   public/og-preview.png - rendered by node-canvas, whose font rasterisation
#                           differs between machines and library versions
# `npm run build` regenerates both. `npm run check:clean-build` guards this.
public/sitemap.xml
public/og-preview.png
